# Shunter of the Month – Visual Reference (Design to Follow)

Use this when improving admin page or any card/section that should match the main-page "Shunter of the Month" card style.

## Reference component

- **File:** `src/components/User/ShunterOfTheMonthCard.jsx`
- **Context:** Rendered on main page (Calendar route) above the calendar.

---

## 1. Container (main card)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Wrapper margin/padding | `mb-3 px-4 mt-2` |
| Max width | `max-w-4xl mx-auto` |
| Background | `bg-white` |
| Border | `border border-gray-200` |
| Corners | `rounded-xl` (1rem) |
| Shadow | `shadow-sm` |
| Overflow | `overflow-hidden` (for header + expandable content) |

**Full container class:**  
`max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden`

---

## 2. Expandable header (clickable bar)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Layout | `w-full px-4 py-3 flex items-center justify-between` |
| Background | `bg-gradient-to-r from-amber-50 via-yellow-50 to-orange-50` |
| Bottom border | `border-b border-amber-100` |
| Title text | `text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800` |
| Chevron icon | `w-4 h-4 text-amber-500`, `transition-transform duration-200`, `rotate-180` when open |

---

## 3. Expandable content (body)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Top border | `border-t border-gray-100` |
| Overflow | `overflow-hidden` |
| Transition | `transition-all duration-200 ease-out` |
| Open state | `max-h-80 opacity-100` |
| Closed state | `max-h-0 opacity-0` |
| Inner padding | `p-2 space-y-2` |

---

## 4. Inner row cards (e.g. per month)

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Padding | `px-3 py-2.5` |
| Corners | `rounded-lg` |
| Layout | `flex flex-col gap-1.5 md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between` |
| Alternating backgrounds (4 variants) | `bg-amber-50 border-amber-200`, `bg-blue-50 border-blue-200`, `bg-emerald-50 border-emerald-200`, `bg-purple-50 border-purple-200` |
| Month label | `text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wide` + matching color: `text-amber-700`, `text-blue-700`, `text-emerald-700`, `text-purple-700` |
| Names/value text | `text-sm font-semibold text-charcoal` |
| Placeholder when empty | `text-sm text-gray-400` (e.g. "—") |

---

## 5. Loading state

| Property | Value |
|----------|--------|
| Same outer wrapper | `mb-3 px-4 mt-2` |
| Card shell | Same as container: `max-w-4xl mx-auto bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm`, plus `px-4 py-3 min-h-[48px] flex items-center` |
| Skeleton | `h-4 w-40 bg-gray-100 rounded animate-pulse` |

---

## 6. Project colors (Tailwind config)

- **charcoal:** `#2D2D2D` – primary text (`text-charcoal`)
- **offwhite:** `#FAFAFA` – page background (`bg-offwhite`)
- **cream:** `#F5F5F0`
- **softgray:** `#E0E0E0`
- **mediumgray:** `#9E9E9E`

---

## 7. Typography

- No custom font-family in theme; uses Tailwind default (system UI stack).
- Sizes used in reference: `text-xs`, `text-sm`, `font-semibold`, `font-bold`, `uppercase`, `tracking-wide`.

---

## 8. Responsive

- Card: full width with horizontal padding `px-4`; `max-w-4xl mx-auto` centers on large screens.
- Rows: stack on mobile (`flex-col gap-1.5`), row on `md:` (`md:flex-row md:items-center md:justify-between`).
- Names block: `flex flex-col gap-1` on mobile, `md:flex-row md:items-center md:gap-6` on desktop.

---

## 9. Do not use (from old admin Shunter manager)

- Avoid `rounded-xl border border-red-200 bg-yellow-50/80` for the **main/user-facing** Shunter card (that one uses gradient header + white card).
- **Admin sections** (e.g. Settings, Shunter of the Month Manager) **do** use red header + yellow container: card `border-red-200 bg-yellow-50/80`, header `bg-red-50 border-b border-red-200/60`, title `text-red-800`, content `bg-yellow-50/50 border-t border-red-100`.
- Avoid red header `bg-red-50` only on the **user-facing** Shunter card; prefer the gradient header there.

---

## 10. Summary checklist for new sections

- [ ] Container: `bg-white border border-gray-200 rounded-xl shadow-sm overflow-hidden`, `max-w-4xl mx-auto` where appropriate
- [ ] Expandable header: gradient `from-amber-50 via-yellow-50 to-orange-50`, `border-b border-amber-100`, title `text-sm font-semibold text-amber-800`
- [ ] Content: `border-t border-gray-100`, `transition-all duration-200 ease-out`, max-height + opacity for open/close
- [ ] Inner cards: `rounded-lg`, alternating soft tints (amber/blue/emerald/purple) with matching borders and text
- [ ] Text: `text-charcoal` for main content, `text-xs`/`text-sm` for labels and values
- [ ] Responsive: `flex-col` + `md:flex-row` where horizontal layout is needed on desktop
- [ ] Buttons: outline only (rounded border, no fill) – `bg-white text-charcoal border border-gray-300 hover:bg-gray-50`; destructive outline if needed: `border-red-500 text-red-600 hover:bg-red-50`
- [ ] Admin sections: red header + yellow container (card `border-red-200 bg-yellow-50/80`, header `bg-red-50`, title `text-red-800`, content `bg-yellow-50/50`).
- [ ] **Inner cards on yellow background:** use `bg-white` with colored border (e.g. `border-amber-200`, `border-blue-200`) so they contrast; do not use yellow/amber tints (e.g. `bg-amber-50`) on yellow container – they become invisible.
